Game data
---------
kjk contains no data from any game. It reads Star Wars: Knights of the
Old Republic, Star Wars: Knights of the Old Republic II - The Sith Lords and
Star Wars Jedi Knight: Jedi Academy from installs the player already owns.
Nothing from those games is shipped in this repository or in any release.

Star Wars, Knights of the Old Republic and Jedi Academy are trademarks of
their respective owners. kjk is not affiliated with or endorsed by them.

Behaviour references
--------------------
These projects were read to understand how the original engines behave. No
code from them is included, translated or adapted; the parts of kjk that
match their behaviour were written from behaviour specifications by people
who had not read their source.

OpenJK   https://github.com/JACoders/OpenJK   GNU GPL v2
reone    https://github.com/seedhartha/reone  GNU GPL v3
xoreos   https://github.com/xoreos/xoreos     GNU GPL v3
iw4L     https://github.com/vladtrc/iw4L      Apache License 2.0 (structure and working method)

Steam
-----
Binary releases do not include Steam. A build made from source with the
`steam` feature (the default) links Valve's Steam API library
(libsteam_api.dylib, steam_api64.dll or libsteam_api.so), the Steamworks
SDK's redistributable as the steamworks-sys crate ships it, for co-op
through Steam. It is Valve's, under the Steamworks SDK's terms, not the MIT
License. Steam and the Steam logo are trademarks of Valve Corporation.

Binary releases include THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.html for the Rust crates they
are built from.
